Python 3.12.15_1 native runtime preparation, 2026-10-09
Source: https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-31215/
Archive SHA256 verified against the release page:
c2c4321961fab0fb999d66e0cecf521c2ab3994c7992873ea99e306c1094fd5a

CVE-2025-15367: POP3 rejects C0/DEL controls before sending a command.
Backport of CPython b234a2b67539f787e191d2ef19a7cbdce32874e7.
https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/b234a2b67539f787e191d2ef19a7cbdce32874e7
Upstream held this change out of older branches for compatibility; this
5BSD port deliberately rejects previously accepted control characters in
POP3 usernames/passwords, matching the upstream fix.

CVE-2025-15366: IMAP rejects NUL/CR/LF command arguments; other controls
are not rejected. Adapted from CPython's narrow 3.13 backport:
https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/71926d943c05bde79bd2a866933103541d91b6a2
The 3.12 API still requires callers to quote mailbox names. Tests preserve
that behavior, check str/bytes inputs, and permit a quoted tab.

The upstream POP3 and IMAP suites with adapted regression cases pass on
the rebuilt native Python 3.12.15 interpreter: 178 tests, 172 pass, six
skipped, no failures. Four skips require external network resources; two
are disabled upstream because the remote Cyrus server blocks connections.
All 93 Mojo packaged-importer/extension cases also pass against this runtime.
Evidence: /usr/obj/mojo-port-validation/2026-10-09/python-security/ and
python315-package-interop-retry/. Clean VM package validation is pending.

The local VuXML ranges mark only python312 >= 3.12.15_1 fixed for these
two backports. A flattened copy of the complete local advisory database
is used for this build's audit; vulnerability checks are not disabled.
The system-wide interpreter and vulnerability database are unchanged.

The native VM installation check exposed an undeclared libb2 dependency from
Python's BLAKE2 module. LIB_DEPENDS now declares libb2.so:devel/libb2; the native
libb2 package is included in the verified runtime closure. BLAKE2b and BLAKE2s
known-answer checks pass with that staged library. Clean VM validation continues.
